<<<
dandiacal, dandyfied. The amusement provided by incorrect formations like dandiacal (as though there were a dandiac corresponding to maniac &c.) is evanescent, & the words should be allowed to vanish with it, especially when an alternative word exists, as here.
===
**dandiacal, dandyfied.** The amusement provided by incorrect formations like *dandiacal* (as though there were a *dandiac* corresponding to *maniac* &c.) is evanescent, & the words should be allowed to vanish with it, especially when an alternative word exists, as here.
>>>

